        "text": "Very professional and compassionate. This man made an emergency detour to help us out during the latest ice storm that had all our electrical wiring destroyed by a fallen tree. He checked our installation for safety and made sure Hydro-Quebec would do their part in a timely manner (they arrived a few hours later). I would give him three thumbs up if I could! Very professional master electrician. He made a special detour to help us during the last ice storm. Our electrical wires had been severed by a fallen tree. He checked our installation and made a request to Hydro-Quebec to have our electrical wire connected as quickly as possible.",
